  "contract": "Issues #11234 and #11264. Ascension client caches place the Drowned Diver's Signet, Drowned Diver's Helmet and Scuba Slayer's Blade together in the cave under Splithoof Crag. Their cached height (about z -80) is a sealed hollow under our client's cave floor, and the floor straight above it is broken rock, so the pickups stand on the flat cave floor 3 yd south-west at z -64.55. Before, they sat on the cliff slope of the crag top, the ring 50 yd down the drop, where players slid off. Each item now has one pickup resting on the cave floor with open space around and above it.",
